From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 08:54:39 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 054/106] Unified: a hole where a flat face was clicked

PartDesign's hole needs a sketch with circles or points; on a plain face
it failed with "no axis found". The hole of the integrated environment
(toolbar, Model menu and context bar) makes that sketch itself: a point
where the face was clicked, on a sketch on the face, then opens
PartDesign's hole. If the hole is cancelled the sketch is removed again.
With a sketch or a face with circles it runs PartDesign's hole as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
